station-event-headcrabMigration-announcement = Attention. Unknown hostile life forms have been detected crawling through the vent systems. Air pockets and dark corners are to be considered unsafe until further notice.

station-event-antlionRaid-announcement = Attention. Colonial forces report nest activity in the drainage network. Excavated tunnels have breached the perimeter — stay away from grates and broken floors.

station-event-combineSweep-announcement = Civil protection advisory: an autonomous sweep is being conducted in this sector. Civilian interference with Combine equipment is punishable by terminal processing.
